   "text": "University of Hartford (Postgraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Hartford (Postgraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nSpread across seven dynamic schools and colleges, UHart is a four-year private nonprofit university that has been guiding the purpose and passion of undergraduate and graduate students for over six decades. Centrally located alongside Connecticut’s capital city and midway between Boston and New York City, our 350-acre campus offers big opportunities, from major industry partnerships to vibrant cultural destinations. University of Hartford's ranking in the 2021 edition of Best Colleges is National Universities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 11:04\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 11:04\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$50,000.00\nMin: US$47,334.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n612 of 6,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1957\nCampus(es)\nWest Hartford\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VrLnHGvsooE\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
